WEBVTT

01:26.370 --> 01:29.770
[Glory]

01:30.590 --> 01:32.950
[Episode 14]

01:41.200 --> 01:43.060
Lady Rong, I've brought him here.

01:49.840 --> 01:52.039
It was you who killed my granddaughter?

01:53.070 --> 01:53.710
Lady Rong,

01:54.479 --> 01:56.070
what makes you say that?

01:56.310 --> 01:56.950
Mr. Bai,

01:57.600 --> 01:58.780
Lady Yunwan was tragically

01:58.780 --> 02:00.350
found drowned in the back garden.

02:00.350 --> 02:01.410
The garden patrol claimed

02:01.410 --> 02:02.350
to have seen you fleeing in panic

02:02.350 --> 02:03.290
through the east corner gate.

02:03.290 --> 02:05.400
Explain yourself to Lady Rong immediately.

02:05.400 --> 02:06.040
I didn't.

02:07.440 --> 02:08.039
Lady Rong,

02:09.080 --> 02:09.810
it wasn't me.

02:10.240 --> 02:10.900
Tonight...

02:10.960 --> 02:11.960
Think carefully.

02:12.240 --> 02:13.840
Who were you with tonight?

02:18.380 --> 02:19.190
It was Mr. He.

02:19.800 --> 02:20.860
It was He Xingming.

02:21.000 --> 02:22.150
He invited me for drinks.

02:22.150 --> 02:22.750
He said...

02:23.390 --> 02:24.280
Lady Rong.

02:27.150 --> 02:29.150
Mr. Bai is indeed telling the truth.

02:29.560 --> 02:31.079
Tonight I prepared a feast

02:31.400 --> 02:32.750
and invited him to join me.

02:32.750 --> 02:33.520
However...

02:33.520 --> 02:35.430
Just yesterday you loathed him to the bone

02:35.430 --> 02:36.829
and swore to be his mortal enemy.

02:36.829 --> 02:39.030
Yet tonight you sat with him for a drink.

02:39.110 --> 02:40.310
Mr. He, your feelings

02:40.590 --> 02:41.920
change rather quickly.

02:44.840 --> 02:47.079
There was never any deep hatred
between us.

02:47.079 --> 02:49.030
Plus, Lady Yunxi mediated between us.

02:49.030 --> 02:49.840
What grievance

02:49.840 --> 02:51.100
couldn't be resolved?

02:51.600 --> 02:53.680
But Mr. Bai has little tolerance for wine,

02:53.680 --> 02:55.590
and he grew tipsy after only two cups.

02:55.590 --> 02:56.430
I personally

02:56.430 --> 02:58.090
escorted him back to his room.

02:58.120 --> 03:00.050
Then I went back to my room to sleep.

03:00.400 --> 03:01.750
I have no idea

03:02.190 --> 03:03.430
whether he sobered up later

03:03.430 --> 03:04.520
or where he went.

03:05.840 --> 03:06.700
I remember now.

03:07.120 --> 03:09.400
During the meal,
Mr. Bai seemed utterly distracted,

03:09.400 --> 03:11.260
muttering constantly that he had

03:11.350 --> 03:12.550
certain appointment

03:12.840 --> 03:14.590
with Lady Yunshu.

03:15.360 --> 03:17.120
I suppose
he sneaked into the rear courtyard

03:17.120 --> 03:18.560
to meet Lady Yunshu.

03:20.120 --> 03:20.840
Yunshu?

03:21.760 --> 03:23.820
I had my maid Daisy take him a message,

03:24.430 --> 03:27.040
saying I'd meet him
in the garden at 9 in the evening.

03:27.040 --> 03:29.030
I waited under the peach tree
in the west garden,

03:29.030 --> 03:30.290
but he never showed up,

03:30.840 --> 03:31.870
so I had to go back.

03:32.430 --> 03:34.910
The message clearly said
to meet at 11 p.m.

03:35.280 --> 03:36.710
at the southeast gate.

03:39.210 --> 03:40.250
If there is a written note,

03:40.250 --> 03:41.180
then where is it?

03:41.870 --> 03:42.680
It was on me.

03:44.260 --> 03:45.460
I kept it in my pocket.

03:45.590 --> 03:46.920
How could it be missing?

03:55.280 --> 03:56.870
Murder always has a motive.

03:57.200 --> 03:58.600
Mr. Bai held no grudge

03:58.620 --> 03:59.820
against Lady Yunwan.

04:00.000 --> 04:01.200
Why would he harm her?

04:03.840 --> 04:05.590
If Lady Yunwan had any enemies,

04:05.960 --> 04:06.910
unless...

04:08.240 --> 04:09.900
Could it be about those shoes?

04:10.280 --> 04:11.810
Was it because of the shoes?

04:13.240 --> 04:14.080
What shoes?

04:14.430 --> 04:16.089
Can you explain more clearly?

04:16.430 --> 04:17.230
Grandmother,

04:17.370 --> 04:19.300
Yunyin suddenly remembered today

04:19.440 --> 04:21.510
that there was
a bloodstain in Mr. Yang's room.

04:21.510 --> 04:23.910
That bloodstain turned out to be Wanwan's.

04:34.360 --> 04:36.560
That bloodstain really was Wanwan's?

04:37.100 --> 04:38.700
You recognized it all along?

04:39.159 --> 04:40.620
Forgive me, Grandmother.

04:40.680 --> 04:42.210
Wanwan was still very young

04:42.250 --> 04:43.710
and quite simple-minded.

04:44.560 --> 04:46.680
No one in the mansion ever stopped her
from wandering around.

04:46.680 --> 04:49.000
She must have entered
that room by accident.

04:49.000 --> 04:49.920
I was afraid that if word spread,

04:49.920 --> 04:51.580
people would gossip about it,

04:51.630 --> 04:53.760
so I didn't dare
to speak up right away.

04:53.800 --> 04:55.330
I quietly burned the shoes.

04:57.190 --> 04:58.800
I suppose

04:58.800 --> 04:59.510
that Yunwan must have seen something

04:59.510 --> 05:00.920
she shouldn't have that night,

05:00.920 --> 05:03.320
and that was
what brought about her demise.

05:03.800 --> 05:04.600
Could it be...

05:05.110 --> 05:05.840
Who's there?

05:12.120 --> 05:14.120
What are you sneaking around for?

05:15.390 --> 05:15.990
Lady Rong.

05:16.240 --> 05:17.360
I am Hua who manages

05:17.580 --> 05:19.390
tea serving at Xinfang Pavilion.

05:19.390 --> 05:20.950
I heard commotion in the garden,

05:20.950 --> 05:22.600
so I came to see
what was happening out of curiosity.

05:22.600 --> 05:23.200
Lady Rong.

05:23.430 --> 05:24.800
He is a servant of the mansion,

05:24.800 --> 05:26.070
temporarily assigned to Mr. Bai

05:26.070 --> 05:27.800
to attend to his writing needs.

05:28.260 --> 05:30.070
How dare you deceive Lady Rong right here?

05:30.070 --> 05:32.270
Speak the truth or receive fifty lashes!

05:32.270 --> 05:32.920
Mercy!

05:32.940 --> 05:34.820
I'll talk! I'll talk!

05:35.750 --> 05:36.360
Lady Rong.

05:37.390 --> 05:39.250
If Mr. Bai really killed someone,

05:39.360 --> 05:40.909
it'd have nothing to do with us servants,

05:40.909 --> 05:42.240
please don't arrest me.

05:42.460 --> 05:43.830
He used to

05:43.830 --> 05:45.240
curse Mr. Yang frequently,

05:45.240 --> 05:46.870
calling him vile, shameless,

05:46.870 --> 05:47.870
and a total bully.

05:48.830 --> 05:49.690
He also said...

05:50.040 --> 05:50.900
What did he say?

05:51.060 --> 05:52.000
Sometimes he said

05:52.000 --> 05:53.870
Miss Rong was blind in both eyes and heart

05:53.870 --> 05:55.800
for choosing such a scoundrel.

05:56.390 --> 05:57.510
Other times he said Mr. Yang

05:57.510 --> 05:58.340
was unworthy of his position

05:58.340 --> 06:00.120
and would meet with catastrophic disaster.

06:00.120 --> 06:01.520
Mr. Yang died violently,

06:01.690 --> 06:02.920
and Lady Yunwan was also gone.

06:02.920 --> 06:04.120
Something Mr. Bai used to say

06:04.120 --> 06:04.870
comes back to me now,

06:04.870 --> 06:06.680
and I became more and more frightened.

06:06.680 --> 06:09.210
That...That's why I came
to look into things.

06:12.150 --> 06:12.950
You're lying!

06:13.510 --> 06:15.240
When did I ever say such things?

06:19.390 --> 06:20.160
Well, well!

06:20.750 --> 06:22.430
Now there's no way of denying it.

06:22.430 --> 06:23.890
You killed Yang Dingchen,

06:24.120 --> 06:25.450
and Wanwan accidentally discovered it,

06:25.450 --> 06:26.480
so you simply steeled your heart

06:26.480 --> 06:28.140
and killed her as well? Right?

06:28.240 --> 06:30.070
If the night patrol hadn't found out,

06:30.070 --> 06:32.330
who would have suspected that it was you?

06:32.810 --> 06:33.540
Lady Yunshu.

06:34.630 --> 06:36.360
I remember you personally said

06:36.690 --> 06:38.409
that on the day Mr. Yang was killed,

06:38.409 --> 06:39.850
you were with Mr. Bai.

06:40.240 --> 06:42.560
Please testify for Mr. Bai.

06:43.850 --> 06:44.409
Yunshu?

06:45.760 --> 06:47.159
I...I...

06:47.270 --> 06:47.920
Lady Rong.

06:48.390 --> 06:50.150
Lady Yunshu was talking with Mr. Bai,

06:50.150 --> 06:52.070
and I was only watching from a distance.

06:52.070 --> 06:53.360
Later, the night breeze grew too chilly,

06:53.360 --> 06:54.870
so I went back to get a cloak for her.

06:54.870 --> 06:56.600
When I returned,

06:57.190 --> 06:59.320
Mr. Bai had only just come back as well.

06:59.320 --> 07:01.910
At that moment, Yunshu mentioned
catching the scent of peach blossoms,

07:01.910 --> 07:02.500
so I thought to pick

07:02.500 --> 07:04.560
a few of the prettier flowers for her.

07:05.070 --> 07:07.270
The walk between the peach grove
and Qilan Garden

07:07.270 --> 07:09.070
takes no more than10 minutes.

07:10.320 --> 07:11.780
I'm afraid Yunshu's alibi

07:12.240 --> 07:13.510
won't hold.

07:13.750 --> 07:14.360
Yunshu?

07:15.430 --> 07:16.760
What happened on earth?

07:17.500 --> 07:18.760
I'm just a blind woman.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.390
How would I know

07:20.950 --> 07:22.190
if others lied to me?

07:23.400 --> 07:24.870
You force me to testify,

07:25.480 --> 07:26.950
but who can I testify for?

07:33.080 --> 07:34.890
Lady Rong has always been fair and strict.

07:34.890 --> 07:36.750
This is a matter of life and death.

07:36.909 --> 07:38.330
Somebody seeks to weave wild speculation

07:38.330 --> 07:39.600
from mere scraps of words,

07:39.600 --> 07:41.710
passing life-and-death judgments
on shadows without substance.

07:41.710 --> 07:43.060
If this were to spread, it'd tarnish

07:43.060 --> 07:44.790
the Rong family's reputation.

07:45.710 --> 07:46.700
Please, Lady Rong,

07:46.700 --> 07:48.040
to give us a few more days,

07:48.040 --> 07:49.650
so we can find out solid evidence

07:49.650 --> 07:51.950
We must not wrongly accuse
an innocent person.

07:51.950 --> 07:53.800
With so many witnesses and evidence,

07:53.800 --> 07:55.720
we practically caught them red-handed.

07:55.720 --> 07:56.430
Mr. Lu,

07:56.830 --> 07:58.560
what more evidence do you need?

07:59.390 --> 08:01.240
You're not in cahoots with them, are you?

08:01.240 --> 08:01.650
You...

08:01.870 --> 08:02.430
Enough!

08:03.120 --> 08:04.180
Stop this arguing.

08:04.800 --> 08:06.860
The Rong family can't pass judgment.

08:06.870 --> 08:09.730
Had them bound
and taken to the government tonight!

08:10.200 --> 08:10.720
Yes.

08:12.370 --> 08:13.830
During the court inquiry,

08:14.160 --> 08:15.360
besides the suspect,

08:15.590 --> 08:17.770
they'll certainly
question everyone involved.

08:17.770 --> 08:19.490
This servant, Hua, accused Bai Yingsheng

08:19.490 --> 08:21.960
of killing out of hatred and jealousy,
so he must go.

08:21.960 --> 08:22.960
As for the others,

08:23.820 --> 08:26.310
Mr. He who invited the suspect
for drinks that night,

08:26.310 --> 08:28.620
the servant Hesi
who served them during the meal,

08:28.620 --> 08:30.740
and those on duty at Qilan Garden,

08:31.040 --> 08:32.039
Xinfang Pavilion,

08:32.039 --> 08:33.120
and the garden,

08:33.909 --> 08:35.200
must all go as well.

08:37.120 --> 08:38.780
You have no right to talk here.

08:59.670 --> 09:00.470
Grandmother,

09:01.550 --> 09:03.080
Mr. Lu is absolutely right.

09:04.270 --> 09:05.840
To give Yunwan justice,

09:06.380 --> 09:09.360
everyone who should be questioned
must be questioned.

09:09.360 --> 09:09.910
Good.

09:11.240 --> 09:12.360
Let's do as you say.

09:24.310 --> 09:25.970
Wanwan hated being confined.

09:30.480 --> 09:32.610
She was especially afraid of silence.

09:33.720 --> 09:35.250
If she were locked in a room,

09:36.200 --> 09:37.530
she'd cry, make a scene,

09:38.080 --> 09:39.540
and refuse to eat for days.

09:42.240 --> 09:43.150
It was my fault.

09:45.150 --> 09:46.950
I should have kept her confined.

09:49.590 --> 09:50.790
If I were Lady Yunwan,

09:51.830 --> 09:53.290
I wouldn't want to survive

09:53.940 --> 09:55.800
by being locked up like an animal.

09:56.470 --> 09:58.270
Nobody could go against her will

09:58.510 --> 09:59.440
and imprison her

09:59.440 --> 10:00.970
in this small room forever.

10:02.180 --> 10:03.440
If anyone were guilty,

10:03.710 --> 10:06.080
those who killed and harmed her
should be the guilty ones.

10:06.080 --> 10:08.280
How could you have done anything wrong?

10:09.940 --> 10:11.740
I know you're feeling terrible,

10:12.430 --> 10:14.760
but this is not the time
to drown in sorrow.

10:14.940 --> 10:16.400
He Xingming and Lady Yunxi

10:17.150 --> 10:18.520
have far greater ambitions.

10:18.520 --> 10:19.600
Their target was never

10:19.600 --> 10:20.800
Bai Yingsheng alone.

10:25.740 --> 10:26.870
You must be careful.

10:27.850 --> 10:29.970
Be very cautious.

10:31.600 --> 10:32.480
You mean...

10:33.080 --> 10:34.540
No thief can hide forever.

10:34.920 --> 10:36.320
What they're truly after

10:36.580 --> 10:38.110
will be clear in a day or two.

10:47.850 --> 10:50.180
I wish to arrange Wanwan's funeral first.

11:03.970 --> 11:05.430
Who told you to take a life?

11:07.750 --> 11:08.950
When we discussed it,

11:09.720 --> 11:11.550
didn't you nod in agreement as well?

11:11.550 --> 11:12.810
What are you angry about now?

11:12.810 --> 11:14.340
I only told you to scare her,

11:14.390 --> 11:15.440
to force her to tell what she saw

11:15.440 --> 11:16.630
in the bridal chamber.

11:16.630 --> 11:17.390
I had my own way

11:17.390 --> 11:19.120
to make her turn against Rong Shanbao

11:19.120 --> 11:20.700
and reveal
the true or false Tea Bone case.

11:20.700 --> 11:22.510
Who told you to actually kill her?

11:22.510 --> 11:23.920
Although she was simple-minded,

11:23.920 --> 11:25.160
she was still my cousin

11:25.160 --> 11:26.890
and a member of the Rong family.

11:27.730 --> 11:29.390
You've broken my principles!

11:32.720 --> 11:34.320
What principles do you have?

11:35.510 --> 11:37.360
I resent Old Madam Rong's favoritism

11:37.360 --> 11:39.360
and can't stand Rong Shanbao's dominance,

11:39.360 --> 11:41.030
but I have my principles as well.

11:41.030 --> 11:41.600
I'd never use

11:41.600 --> 11:42.870
such despicable means

11:42.910 --> 11:43.510
to murder

11:43.510 --> 11:45.170
a mentally disordered child.

11:47.120 --> 11:49.000
What nonsense about the Tea Bone.

11:49.440 --> 11:50.550
Only people from the Rong family

11:50.550 --> 11:52.150
care about such empty words.

11:53.030 --> 11:54.120
How could the good reputation Rong Shanbao

11:54.120 --> 11:56.200
built over many years in the tea business

11:56.200 --> 11:57.480
be undone

11:57.480 --> 11:59.030
by this counterfeit Tea Bone?

11:59.030 --> 12:00.490
Now look what's happened.

12:00.600 --> 12:01.120
Rong Yunwan

12:01.120 --> 12:02.650
died under her protection.

12:02.870 --> 12:04.870
How can she escape responsibility?

12:05.890 --> 12:07.320
Lady Rong may not say it,

12:07.790 --> 12:09.250
but she's furious inside.

12:11.870 --> 12:14.000
You seem to hate her even more than I do.

12:14.200 --> 12:16.030
You're so passionate about

12:16.270 --> 12:18.200
these harmful and spiteful deeds.

12:19.600 --> 12:20.670
I do hate her.

12:21.510 --> 12:23.120
We've been at odds

12:23.270 --> 12:25.030
since the first day we met, at fourteen.

12:25.030 --> 12:27.150
All these years of
rivalry between our families

12:27.150 --> 12:29.410
have only made me despise her to the bone.

12:32.120 --> 12:33.200
But everything I do

12:36.480 --> 12:37.600
is for you.

12:40.960 --> 12:42.890
We're meant to be a devoted couple.

12:43.270 --> 12:45.030
Of course, I want the Rong family

12:45.030 --> 12:47.160
to be in your hands as soon as possible.

12:55.630 --> 12:56.830
Just wait patiently.

12:58.320 --> 12:59.250
In the future,

12:59.630 --> 13:02.090
there'll be many more shows
for you to watch.

13:16.750 --> 13:17.550
Yunxi,

13:18.140 --> 13:20.870
you should get a man
of gentle and kind character.

13:21.180 --> 13:22.460
The one you've got

13:22.480 --> 13:23.830
is a predator.

13:26.910 --> 13:27.600
Look,

13:28.080 --> 13:28.630
who knows how long

13:28.630 --> 13:29.840
he's been plotting?

13:30.290 --> 13:31.960
He even managed to buy off those

13:31.960 --> 13:33.420
who served Bai Yingsheng.

13:33.480 --> 13:35.170
In my life, I despise nothing more than

13:35.170 --> 13:36.560
arrogant, ill-mannered men

13:36.560 --> 13:38.090
who don't know their place.

13:38.720 --> 13:40.900
No wonder Rong Shanbao didn't like him.

13:40.900 --> 13:42.700
If he were to enter the Rong family,

13:42.700 --> 13:44.300
he'd bring nothing but trouble,

13:44.300 --> 13:46.400
and become the cause
of our family's downfall.

13:46.400 --> 13:48.330
If I didn't still need to use him...

13:50.050 --> 13:50.790
However, I've noticed

13:50.790 --> 13:51.870
that Yunyin's expression

13:51.870 --> 13:52.930
didn't look right.

13:53.510 --> 13:54.710
She acts tough, lacks courage,

13:54.710 --> 13:56.120
hesitates to make decisions,

13:56.120 --> 13:58.120
and can't dwell on weighty matters.

13:58.870 --> 14:00.870
We must keep this from her for now.

14:01.870 --> 14:03.130
I'll keep an eye on her.

14:12.510 --> 14:14.370
I know you care deeply for Yunwan.

14:14.630 --> 14:16.000
It'd be enough to ask the monks
to chant sutras

14:16.000 --> 14:17.230
for a few more days
to help her soul find peace.

14:17.230 --> 14:18.960
But you bathed her, combed her hair,
changed her clothes,

14:18.960 --> 14:20.120
and then even personally escorted her out,

14:20.120 --> 14:21.720
which broke a serious taboo.

14:22.000 --> 14:24.060
Grandmother was furious about this.

14:24.390 --> 14:25.080
First of all,

14:25.080 --> 14:26.680
according to our family principles,

14:26.680 --> 14:28.920
women handle births,
and men handle funerals.

14:28.920 --> 14:30.440
No matter how close you are to someone,

14:30.440 --> 14:31.150
funeral matters

14:31.150 --> 14:32.630
should be handled by men.

14:33.360 --> 14:34.750
By personally handling the funeral,

14:34.750 --> 14:37.680
if you exposed yourself to bad luck,
what could we do?

14:38.830 --> 14:39.510
Secondly,

14:40.240 --> 14:41.870
Yunwan's situation was already awkward.

14:41.870 --> 14:42.910
In Linji City,

14:42.910 --> 14:45.110
there was no such person as Lady Yunwan.

14:45.780 --> 14:48.140
Grandmother had good reason
to not hold a funeral.

14:48.140 --> 14:49.140
But by doing this,

14:49.630 --> 14:50.200
you've given people reasons

14:50.200 --> 14:51.600
to gossip in front of Grandmother

14:51.600 --> 14:52.930
and make up your faults.

14:55.670 --> 14:57.070
I'm not afraid of gossip,

14:57.670 --> 14:58.550
and Yunwan wouldn't object to

14:58.550 --> 15:00.550
the Rong family
presiding over the funeral.

15:00.550 --> 15:01.600
When she was born,

15:02.440 --> 15:03.900
I was the first to hold her.

15:04.670 --> 15:05.870
When she passed away,

15:06.870 --> 15:09.150
it'd be enough
that I alone could see her off.

15:09.150 --> 15:10.750
Wanwan loved bright colors.

15:12.000 --> 15:12.960
Bring me the new outfit

15:12.960 --> 15:14.560
I made for her in pale yellow.

15:25.790 --> 15:26.510
Miss Rong,

15:27.440 --> 15:29.170
we're still sisters after all.

15:29.510 --> 15:31.030
No matter how harsh our words,

15:31.030 --> 15:32.830
we can't let her go in our hearts.

15:33.030 --> 15:34.440
Even if Miss Rong doesn't mention it,

15:34.440 --> 15:36.720
we should still come and pay our respects.

15:36.720 --> 15:38.460
How many days will she be laid out

15:38.460 --> 15:39.580
before the burial?

15:39.910 --> 15:41.840
Is there anything we can help with?

15:42.080 --> 15:44.480
Though it's not proper
for us to manage funerals,

15:44.480 --> 15:46.240
we should still come and see her.

15:46.240 --> 15:48.630
The funeral procession
will begin tomorrow at 2 a.m.,

15:48.630 --> 15:50.160
ground-breaking at 4 a.m.,

15:51.000 --> 15:53.120
and she'll be buried at around 7:45 a.m.

15:53.120 --> 15:53.840
That fast?

15:54.600 --> 15:56.610
Miss Rong consulted
a fortune teller about this.

15:56.610 --> 15:57.930
Yunwan died tragically,

15:57.930 --> 15:59.350
so she must be buried
within the first seven days

15:59.350 --> 16:00.550
and can't get into the family tomb

16:00.550 --> 16:02.480
to avoid offending
our family's ancestors.

16:02.480 --> 16:03.200
Regarding Yunwan's funeral,

16:03.200 --> 16:04.910
I will arrange everything personally.

16:04.910 --> 16:06.440
Outsiders don't need
to be concerned about it.

16:06.440 --> 16:07.240
Please leave.

16:08.670 --> 16:09.330
Outsiders?

16:10.200 --> 16:11.550
Am I no longer part of
the primary branch of the family?

16:11.550 --> 16:12.870
Am I no longer her sister?

16:12.870 --> 16:13.840
You're taking over
all of Yunwan's funeral arrangements

16:13.840 --> 16:14.960
and not allowing us to help at all.

16:14.960 --> 16:16.690
How dare you be so domineering?

16:18.390 --> 16:19.600
You are her sister?

16:23.040 --> 16:24.370
Who do you think you're?

16:34.320 --> 16:35.720
Miss Rong has instructed

16:35.960 --> 16:36.960
that tomorrow at 2 a.m.,

16:36.960 --> 16:38.750
all young ladies should stay away

16:38.750 --> 16:40.150
to avoid getting exposed to bad luck

16:40.150 --> 16:42.080
and offending Lady Rong's taboos.

16:45.870 --> 16:47.270
If you don't want me
to see her off, then alright!

16:47.270 --> 16:48.320
You think I care?

16:49.240 --> 16:50.720
You just go bury that dead girl,

16:50.720 --> 16:52.000
and never come back!

16:57.360 --> 16:58.030
Yunyin,

16:58.470 --> 17:00.470
-Yunyin, wait for me!
-Lady Yunyin.

17:40.550 --> 17:41.610
Have you all heard?

17:41.900 --> 17:44.510
The Rong family
is involved in a murder case.

17:45.750 --> 17:47.400
They all say that Miss Rong

17:47.400 --> 17:48.400
is a fake Tea Bone.

17:48.830 --> 17:50.440
She conspired with her lover

17:50.500 --> 17:53.100
and killed
the real Tea Bone of the Rong family.

17:53.200 --> 17:54.200
That's nonsense!

17:54.510 --> 17:55.750
We have all witnessed

17:55.750 --> 17:57.000
Miss Rong's talent.

17:57.320 --> 17:58.550
The tea she roasted by hand

17:58.550 --> 18:00.360
once fetched
astronomical prices in the capital,

18:00.360 --> 18:01.830
and countless tea plantations

18:01.830 --> 18:02.960
owed their thriving to her generosity.

18:02.960 --> 18:04.220
How could that be fake?

18:04.480 --> 18:05.740
Well, it's hard to say.

18:06.510 --> 18:08.970
I heard from
the manager of Huang's tea house

18:09.000 --> 18:10.510
that the debate
of real versus fake Tea Bone

18:10.510 --> 18:12.270
has been going on for a long time.

18:12.270 --> 18:13.920
At that Tea Ancestor Festival Ceremony,

18:13.920 --> 18:14.680
two people

18:14.680 --> 18:15.880
had a huge argument

18:15.880 --> 18:17.000
over the real and fake Tea Bone issue.

18:17.000 --> 18:17.720
Is that so?

18:17.960 --> 18:18.790
Tell us more!

18:18.960 --> 18:20.240
-Yes, tell us!
-Yes!

18:20.240 --> 18:21.500
Let me tell you slowly.

18:22.200 --> 18:24.510
On the day of
Tea Ancestor Festival Ceremony...

18:24.510 --> 18:25.710
Sir, it's here.

18:27.890 --> 18:28.410
My Lord.

18:33.440 --> 18:33.960
My Lord.

18:35.000 --> 18:36.030
That He Xingming
is from a prominent family

18:36.030 --> 18:37.550
and can't be touched lightly.

18:37.550 --> 18:38.590
We took all the others
back to the Government Office

18:38.590 --> 18:39.850
and detain them temporarily.

18:39.850 --> 18:40.910
As you instructed,

18:40.920 --> 18:42.720
we've detained Bai Yingsheng separately

18:42.720 --> 18:44.520
and put everyone else together.

18:44.960 --> 18:45.820
We've left a spy

18:46.110 --> 18:47.960
to see if anyone
tries to coordinate their stories.

18:47.960 --> 18:48.750
But that Hua

18:48.960 --> 18:49.550
insists

18:49.550 --> 18:51.310
he only overheard some casual talk

18:51.310 --> 18:53.550
and keeps crying that he's been wronged.

18:53.550 --> 18:55.400
These servants of noble families

18:55.400 --> 18:56.400
are very cunning.

18:56.790 --> 18:58.400
No matter how much they're tortured,

18:58.400 --> 18:59.660
they act deaf and mute,

18:59.920 --> 19:01.380
refusing to say anything.

19:01.790 --> 19:03.130
Since I got into the Rong family

19:03.130 --> 19:04.510
and had a informant by my side,

19:04.510 --> 19:06.640
I've realized how formidable they are.

19:06.640 --> 19:08.590
Though masters flaunt their status,

19:08.590 --> 19:10.640
the servants,
bound by their own alliances in the dark,

19:10.640 --> 19:11.970
have the sharpest ears.

19:12.670 --> 19:14.200
Few secrets in this mansion

19:14.480 --> 19:16.270
ever slip past them.

19:17.200 --> 19:18.120
I need to find a way

19:18.120 --> 19:20.180
to pry open their clam-like silence.

19:20.510 --> 19:21.110
But how?

19:36.110 --> 19:38.310
Young Master, what are you doing?

19:43.350 --> 19:44.020
Jun Dai.

19:44.720 --> 19:46.480
You disappear every day around 4 p.m.

19:46.480 --> 19:49.010
You deliver
messages to Miss Rong, don't you?

19:50.020 --> 19:51.680
You wronged me, Young Master!

19:51.750 --> 19:52.750
How would I dare?

19:53.650 --> 19:55.220
You're a servant of the Rong family.

19:55.220 --> 19:56.110
Taking orders from Miss Rong

19:56.110 --> 19:57.310
is quite reasonable.

19:57.350 --> 19:58.350
I won't blame you.

19:59.320 --> 20:01.050
But I need to ask you something.

20:01.320 --> 20:02.920
Who am I

20:03.940 --> 20:04.830
to Miss Rong?

20:08.200 --> 20:09.880
When you first came to the Rong family,

20:09.880 --> 20:10.680
Miss Rong used to ask

20:10.680 --> 20:11.790
about your whereabouts,

20:11.790 --> 20:12.960
who you met each day,

20:12.960 --> 20:14.240
and what you talked about, Young Master.

20:14.240 --> 20:16.640
As time went on,
she asked less frequently.

20:16.920 --> 20:17.960
But since the past month,

20:17.960 --> 20:18.920
Miss Rong

20:18.920 --> 20:19.640
has often summoned me again.

20:19.640 --> 20:21.750
She only asks whether you applies
your medicine on time,

20:21.750 --> 20:23.070
if your old injuries have healed,

20:23.070 --> 20:24.160
if the meals are to your taste,

20:24.160 --> 20:25.130
and if you sleep peacefully.

20:25.130 --> 20:26.000
Nothing else.

20:27.830 --> 20:29.200
With Miss Rong caring so deeply,

20:29.200 --> 20:31.000
your position is clear without asking.

20:31.000 --> 20:32.800
As long as I have any sense at all,

20:33.000 --> 20:34.860
I wouldn't dare speak out of turn.

20:37.110 --> 20:37.710
Is that so?

20:40.080 --> 20:41.240
Do you have some task

20:41.240 --> 20:42.870
for me to carry out, Young Master?

20:42.870 --> 20:44.540
I do have something to ask you to do,

20:44.540 --> 20:46.200
but it involves a murder case.

20:46.620 --> 20:47.940
Who I've met recently,

20:48.290 --> 20:49.150
what I've said,

20:49.150 --> 20:50.540
and the tasks I've asked you to do,

20:50.540 --> 20:51.310
none of these

20:51.310 --> 20:52.710
can be known by Miss Rong.

20:53.030 --> 20:54.510
Do you dare to take this order?

20:54.510 --> 20:56.350
I've been serving by your side

20:56.440 --> 20:58.070
and have long recognized
your exceptional intelligence

20:58.070 --> 20:58.920
and formidable skills, Young Master.

20:58.920 --> 21:00.640
You're destined for greatness.

21:00.640 --> 21:02.230
My little tricks

21:02.470 --> 21:04.000
can't escape your keen eye.

21:05.830 --> 21:07.400
I come from humble origins,

21:07.720 --> 21:08.200
and in the Rong family,

21:08.200 --> 21:10.000
I'm nothing but a lowly servant.

21:10.090 --> 21:12.160
If you honor me with your recognition,

21:12.160 --> 21:13.750
I'd be willing to serve you loyally

21:13.750 --> 21:16.150
and also
secure a better future for myself.

21:18.100 --> 21:19.470
Come, stand up.

21:22.590 --> 21:23.000
Sit.

21:23.000 --> 21:23.460
This...

21:24.090 --> 21:26.020
When I tell you to sit, you just sit.

21:28.530 --> 21:30.450
This time, you're not watching me

21:30.480 --> 21:32.480
on behalf of your Miss Rong anymore?

21:32.790 --> 21:33.750
But you and Miss Rong

21:33.750 --> 21:35.110
will be family sooner or later.

21:35.110 --> 21:36.400
So my loyalty to you

21:36.510 --> 21:38.240
is loyalty to Miss Rong as well.

21:38.510 --> 21:39.310
From now on,

21:39.830 --> 21:41.720
I won't speak what shouldn't be spoken,

21:41.720 --> 21:43.070
won't ask what shouldn't be asked,

21:43.070 --> 21:45.160
and will act solely on your orders,
Young Master.

21:45.160 --> 21:45.720
Good.

21:46.340 --> 21:48.540
I order you to spend a few days in prison.

21:54.940 --> 21:57.070
We've been locked up here for two days.

21:57.110 --> 21:58.920
When will My Lord hear our case?

21:59.750 --> 22:00.480
He's coming!

22:00.500 --> 22:01.220
Lord Cai!

22:01.510 --> 22:02.830
Lord Cai, we are innocent people

22:02.830 --> 22:04.070
who work honestly for our masters.

22:04.070 --> 22:06.130
Please don't wrongfully condemn us.

22:08.440 --> 22:09.640
What's going on here?

22:11.350 --> 22:12.760
Aren't you the one who follows

22:12.760 --> 22:13.560
Mr. Lu around?

22:13.770 --> 22:15.370
How did you end up in here too?

22:15.960 --> 22:17.750
Your backside is beaten to a pulp.

22:17.750 --> 22:18.840
How pitiful.

22:19.910 --> 22:21.170
What has lord been asking about?

22:21.170 --> 22:21.880
Yes, exactly.

22:21.880 --> 22:23.280
How the hell would I know?

22:23.790 --> 22:25.720
I was thrown in here for no reasons.

22:25.880 --> 22:26.880
They questioned me today,

22:26.880 --> 22:28.310
and tomorrow it will be your turn.

22:28.310 --> 22:30.880
None of you grasshoppers
come autumn will escape their fate.

22:30.880 --> 22:31.510
Just wait.

22:33.960 --> 22:34.920
It's sunset already,

22:34.920 --> 22:35.960
but the meal hasn't been delivered yet.

22:35.960 --> 22:37.260
Are you trying to starve my Young Master?

22:37.260 --> 22:38.070
Well, you...

22:38.400 --> 22:39.440
We're cooking. Yes, we're.

22:39.440 --> 22:40.550
I'll bring it to you shortly.

22:40.550 --> 22:41.440
I have other duties to attend to.

22:41.440 --> 22:41.930
Let go!

22:42.620 --> 22:43.750
-Shixin.
-Don’t go.

22:44.830 --> 22:45.430
Let him go.

22:45.720 --> 22:46.520
Young Master.

22:49.300 --> 22:50.060
Go. Leave.

22:55.110 --> 22:56.110
I have something here.

22:56.110 --> 22:57.110
Take this for now.

23:01.030 --> 23:02.450
Xinfang Pavilion is short-staffed.

23:02.450 --> 23:04.380
It's causing some inconvenience.

23:04.850 --> 23:06.120
Steward Cheng
has already arranged for new,

23:06.120 --> 23:07.580
capable personnel to be transferred.

23:07.580 --> 23:08.990
I sincerely ask for
Mr. Yan's understanding and forgiveness.

23:08.990 --> 23:09.790
Not a problem.

23:10.640 --> 23:11.770
I just hope Lord Lang

23:12.070 --> 23:13.600
can uncover the truth soon.

23:20.820 --> 23:22.450
Young Master, don't be fooled by him.

23:22.450 --> 23:23.920
He personally brought you food,

23:23.920 --> 23:25.520
clearly acting as if he's the host.

23:25.520 --> 23:27.640
What kind intentions
could he possibly have?

23:27.640 --> 23:27.960
As for this food box

23:27.960 --> 23:29.350
with golden phoenix and peony patterns,

23:29.350 --> 23:30.440
I've seen it before.

23:30.440 --> 23:32.120
It belongs to Hualin Courtyard.

23:32.120 --> 23:33.200
Miss Rong was worried
that he might be starving,

23:33.200 --> 23:34.590
so she sent someone to bring him food.

23:34.590 --> 23:35.510
He deliberately came to you,

23:35.510 --> 23:36.440
just to show off.

23:36.790 --> 23:38.030
You knew this and still accepted it?

23:38.030 --> 23:38.550
Yes.

23:39.720 --> 23:41.030
Young Master, after you finish eating,

23:41.030 --> 23:43.640
you can return the food box
to Hualin Courtyard yourself.

23:43.640 --> 23:45.110
Miss Rong has just lost
her dear family,

23:45.110 --> 23:46.350
so she must be heartbroken.

23:46.350 --> 23:48.410
Young Master, please go comfort her.

23:48.550 --> 23:49.920
We can then put some pressure on him,

23:49.920 --> 23:52.320
making him lose
both the battle and the war.

23:52.840 --> 23:54.170
You have such sharp eyes

23:54.350 --> 23:55.550
and such a clear mind.

23:55.880 --> 23:57.270
How come you didn't notice

23:57.270 --> 23:59.130
someone is missing from his side?

24:00.750 --> 24:02.150
Weren't all the servants

24:02.510 --> 24:04.440
from Xinfang Pavilion taken away?

24:09.750 --> 24:11.180
When will they release us?

24:11.180 --> 24:12.310
Bring the prisoner.

24:12.560 --> 24:13.620
Someone's coming.

24:25.350 --> 24:25.920
Get up.

24:26.240 --> 24:27.770
Lord wants to question you.

24:29.380 --> 24:31.280
The wounds
on my backside haven't healed yet.

24:31.280 --> 24:32.040
Why me again?

24:32.800 --> 24:34.160
I've already told you everything.

24:34.160 --> 24:35.590
Can you
release me after the interrogation?

24:35.590 --> 24:36.320
Release you?

24:39.310 --> 24:40.970
This is a serious murder case.

24:41.270 --> 24:42.750
Until the real culprit is caught,

24:42.750 --> 24:44.210
Lord can't close the case.

24:44.880 --> 24:46.740
If this drags on for a year or more,

24:46.920 --> 24:48.720
even our lord will be impeached.

24:49.110 --> 24:50.070
By then,

24:50.680 --> 24:52.000
all of you

24:52.640 --> 24:54.360
will just rot in here.

24:56.240 --> 24:57.110
Have mercy, My Lord!

24:57.110 --> 24:58.240
Have mercy, My Lord!

24:58.400 --> 24:59.750
We don't know anything!

24:59.750 --> 25:00.270
My Lord!

25:00.790 --> 25:01.400
My Lord!

25:01.430 --> 25:03.080
We've been wronged, My Lord!

25:04.620 --> 25:05.820
Do you want to get out?

25:08.750 --> 25:10.480
Remember the amount I mentioned yesterday?

25:10.480 --> 25:11.810
What do you mean by that?

25:12.200 --> 25:13.200
Even if you were to weigh me on the scale

25:13.200 --> 25:14.550
and stick a selling tag on me,

25:14.550 --> 25:16.550
I still couldn't
scrape together twenty taels.

25:16.550 --> 25:18.010
Look at how stingy you are.

25:18.160 --> 25:19.830
I won't take your money for nothing.

25:19.830 --> 25:20.480
You know, in this Government Office,

25:20.480 --> 25:21.550
from top to bottom,

25:22.010 --> 25:23.530
the jailers, the guards,

25:23.590 --> 25:24.680
the advisors, the clerks,

25:24.680 --> 25:26.340
who doesn't need to be bribed?

25:26.480 --> 25:27.640
How could we release

25:28.510 --> 25:29.110
a living person

25:29.110 --> 25:31.170
as if they're just nothing randomly?

25:31.880 --> 25:32.960
You must be joking.

25:33.480 --> 25:35.580
We haven't killed or committed arson.

25:35.580 --> 25:37.180
If lord can't find evidence,

25:37.310 --> 25:39.030
he'll have to release us sooner or later.

25:39.030 --> 25:40.820
Do you know what kind of place
this Government Office is?

25:40.820 --> 25:42.130
Keeping interrogating

25:42.130 --> 25:42.990
and being locked up
for three to five months

25:42.990 --> 25:44.120
happen all the time.

25:44.640 --> 25:46.550
All witnesses must be registered.

25:46.550 --> 25:48.080
Once it's written clearly,

25:48.750 --> 25:50.150
even if God himself came,

25:50.790 --> 25:52.520
we wouldn't dare release you randomly.

25:52.520 --> 25:53.720
Are you coming or not?

25:56.640 --> 25:58.040
Come, take that one away.

25:58.720 --> 26:00.030
-My Lord, I’m wronged.
-Get up.

26:00.030 --> 26:01.790
My Lord! I'm innocent! My Lord!

26:02.000 --> 26:02.830
Officer,

26:03.070 --> 26:03.880
I have 20 taels.

26:03.880 --> 26:04.960
Please let me out.

26:08.920 --> 26:10.380
What are you shouting for?

26:11.200 --> 26:12.470
How many times have I told you

26:12.470 --> 26:13.530
to be more prudent?

26:13.930 --> 26:15.350
Yet you're still so blatant.

26:15.350 --> 26:15.880
If this matter

26:15.880 --> 26:16.860
gets to lord's ears,

26:16.860 --> 26:18.320
you'll be in huge trouble.

26:19.400 --> 26:21.730
Next month is Master's birthday banquet.

26:22.030 --> 26:23.110
The money for the opera troupe

26:23.110 --> 26:24.240
hasn't been settled yet.

26:24.240 --> 26:25.070
The small lake in the back garden

26:25.070 --> 26:26.550
still needs a Lake Tai Rock.

26:26.550 --> 26:27.480
Aren't we just

26:27.480 --> 26:28.680
showing our loyalty?

26:33.920 --> 26:34.590
Officer,

26:34.680 --> 26:35.720
I really have the money.

26:35.720 --> 26:36.960
Please let me go.

26:37.350 --> 26:38.480
Important witness,

26:38.790 --> 26:39.680
40 taels.

26:44.880 --> 26:46.340
Do you have 20 taels on you?

26:46.400 --> 26:48.030
If I give them my whole year's income,

26:48.030 --> 26:48.880
what can I take home

26:48.880 --> 26:50.230
to support my mother and siblings?

26:50.230 --> 26:51.490
What can my family eat?

26:51.680 --> 26:52.880
No, I don't have that.

26:53.030 --> 26:55.630
Even if they lock me up forever,
I won't have it.

27:21.990 --> 27:22.680
Come here.

27:27.980 --> 27:28.910
Come closer.

27:29.200 --> 27:31.400
I have something important to tell you.

27:31.680 --> 27:32.640
Come here.

27:35.240 --> 27:36.440
Do you want to get out?

27:36.750 --> 27:37.350
Yes.

27:42.030 --> 27:43.090
What's happening?

27:52.000 --> 27:53.060
What are you doing?

27:57.190 --> 27:58.850
Will this method really work?

27:59.010 --> 28:00.510
The situation has become so serious

28:00.510 --> 28:02.070
that the Rong family
keeps pressuring us to release them.

28:02.070 --> 28:03.270
If we still don't have any solid evidence,

28:03.270 --> 28:04.270
even in front of the Prefect,

28:04.270 --> 28:05.880
I won't be able to explain myself.

28:05.880 --> 28:06.640
Don't worry.

28:07.240 --> 28:08.440
This is an urgent matter.

28:08.440 --> 28:09.770
How can I not be anxious?

28:09.920 --> 28:11.310
Your explanation is ambiguous.

28:11.310 --> 28:11.880
I really don't know

28:11.880 --> 28:13.340
how you plan to catch them.

28:13.740 --> 28:15.870
This tea is too astringent and bitter,

28:16.090 --> 28:16.550
which is not good.

28:16.550 --> 28:17.110
Are you even

28:17.110 --> 28:18.070
listening to me?

28:19.410 --> 28:20.210
Young Master.

28:21.160 --> 28:22.440
I've caught them all!

28:22.680 --> 28:24.010
You really caught them?

28:24.940 --> 28:25.740
Bring them in.

28:28.160 --> 28:28.720
Kneel!

28:30.600 --> 28:32.910
My Lord,
I have successfully completed the mission.

28:32.910 --> 28:33.960
Young Master, you ordered me

28:33.960 --> 28:34.880
to work with these officers

28:34.880 --> 28:35.640
to set up a trap.

28:35.640 --> 28:37.400
Sure enough, this Hua took the bait.

28:37.400 --> 28:38.680
He voluntarily offered 20 taels

28:38.680 --> 28:41.280
to escape
from the Government Office quickly.

28:44.340 --> 28:45.960
A low-ranking servant in the Rong family

28:45.960 --> 28:47.560
working hard for a whole year

28:47.590 --> 28:49.390
would earn no more than 20 taels.

28:49.580 --> 28:50.610
After food, clothing, and daily expenses,

28:50.610 --> 28:51.580
there's barely anything left.

28:51.580 --> 28:53.640
Especially for these young servants

28:53.810 --> 28:55.840
who often gather to drink and gamble,

28:55.840 --> 28:57.610
they don't have much money at all.

28:57.610 --> 28:58.510
The government can't afford

28:58.510 --> 28:59.600
to keep so many idle people.

28:59.600 --> 29:01.180
They'd release them sooner or later.

29:01.180 --> 29:03.220
If he is so anxious to offer 20 taels,

29:03.240 --> 29:06.440
he must have something to hide
and is desperate to escape.

29:06.520 --> 29:08.410
Look at the wound on his neck.

29:08.780 --> 29:09.920
Was it done by Hesi?

29:10.120 --> 29:11.670
My Lord, this scoundrel

29:11.690 --> 29:12.640
smashed a water jug

29:12.640 --> 29:13.620
and hid the pieces in his hand,

29:13.620 --> 29:15.480
being determined to kill people.

29:15.740 --> 29:16.330
Hua.

29:17.140 --> 29:18.750
Others already want to take your life.

29:18.750 --> 29:21.010
Are you still going to remain obstinate?

29:21.310 --> 29:21.840
Speak up.

29:22.440 --> 29:24.240
Where did you get the money from?

29:28.680 --> 29:29.160
Talk!

29:32.110 --> 29:33.000
I'll confess.

29:36.000 --> 29:37.340
Lady Yunwan has been sent away.

29:37.340 --> 29:38.750
You should feel more at ease now, Miss.

29:38.750 --> 29:40.030
Let's go back and drink the calming soup,

29:40.030 --> 29:41.160
and then rest early.

29:41.200 --> 29:43.260
You need to take care of yourself too.

29:46.590 --> 29:48.960
Miss Rong! Miss Rong!

29:50.720 --> 29:52.680
You can't just tie me up like this!

29:53.110 --> 29:54.720
I need to see Miss Rong!

29:55.440 --> 29:56.240
Miss Rong!

29:57.270 --> 29:57.920
Miss Rong!

29:59.270 --> 30:00.520
Please spare me!

30:00.550 --> 30:01.790
Please have mercy!

30:01.920 --> 30:02.880
That night...

30:02.930 --> 30:03.680
That night...

30:03.680 --> 30:05.400
The kitchen's maids were arguing.

30:05.400 --> 30:07.440
Xiu Qiong said she wanted to take a look,

30:07.440 --> 30:09.160
so she asked me
to watch over things for just a moment.

30:09.160 --> 30:10.030
But somehow,

30:10.030 --> 30:12.200
Lady Yunwan suddenly became very agitated.

30:12.200 --> 30:13.480
She spilled the bird's nest soup,

30:13.480 --> 30:14.560
and her clothes got all wet.

30:14.560 --> 30:16.270
I intended to find clean clothes

30:16.270 --> 30:17.600
to help her get changed.

30:18.590 --> 30:19.350
Miss.

30:22.160 --> 30:23.560
I was taken in by the Madam

30:23.640 --> 30:25.590
who found me on the street.

30:25.880 --> 30:26.720
Since I was six years old,

30:26.720 --> 30:28.440
I've been by your side.

30:28.720 --> 30:29.510
Please consider

30:29.510 --> 30:31.550
all these years I've cared for you

30:31.550 --> 30:33.110
and spare me.

30:33.270 --> 30:34.590
Have mercy on me!

30:35.000 --> 30:36.480
Have mercy on me!

30:38.480 --> 30:39.350
Xiu Qiong.

30:39.640 --> 30:40.550
Xiu Qiong,

30:40.550 --> 30:42.110
please plead for me.

30:50.640 --> 30:51.200
Miss.

30:51.350 --> 30:53.070
It was Xiu Qiong
who left her duty that day.

30:53.070 --> 30:54.550
I'm taking the blame for her.

30:54.550 --> 30:55.070
Miss,

30:55.070 --> 30:56.720
it truly wasn't my fault!

30:57.000 --> 30:57.550
Miss,

30:57.550 --> 30:58.070
please consider

30:58.070 --> 31:00.270
all these years of shared sentiment...

31:00.310 --> 31:01.370
Shared sentiment?

31:01.550 --> 31:03.500
Miss is the master,
and you are the servant.

31:03.500 --> 31:05.310
What kind of "shared sentiment"
do you have with Miss?

31:05.310 --> 31:06.240
If it weren't for Madam and Miss

31:06.240 --> 31:07.100
who took you in back then,

31:07.100 --> 31:08.790
your entire family
would have starved to death.

31:08.790 --> 31:09.510
Forgetting to repay

31:09.510 --> 31:11.310
such a profound
life-saving grace is bad enough,

31:11.310 --> 31:13.810
but you've stirred up trouble recklessly,
shown yourself to be narrow-minded,

31:13.810 --> 31:15.350
acted with duplicity, and betrayed trust.

31:15.350 --> 31:15.960
Every single instance of this,

31:15.960 --> 31:17.660
Miss has witnessed with her own eyes.

31:17.660 --> 31:19.400
Recently, Miss Rong has been busy
with funeral arrangements,

31:19.400 --> 31:20.830
so she had no time to deal with you.

31:20.830 --> 31:22.750
But for what you've done behind her back,

31:22.750 --> 31:24.960
even a hundred deaths would not be enough.

31:24.960 --> 31:26.560
Save yourself some dignity.

31:27.070 --> 31:27.870
Take her away.

31:28.160 --> 31:30.240
Miss, I was wrong, and I understand now.

31:30.240 --> 31:30.830
Miss!

31:30.830 --> 31:31.590
It was Lady Yunxi!

31:31.590 --> 31:32.070
Get up.

31:32.070 --> 31:32.680
Lady Yunxi asked me

31:32.680 --> 31:34.810
to take Lady Yunwan to the back garden.

31:34.870 --> 31:37.220
Miss! Miss!

31:39.480 --> 31:40.980
Mr. Bai finds me clumsy

31:41.410 --> 31:43.140
and rarely asks me to serve him.

31:43.440 --> 31:44.910
So I usually work in the back courtyard,

31:44.910 --> 31:46.510
doing some cleaning chores.

31:46.920 --> 31:48.120
That day before dawn,

31:48.480 --> 31:49.590
I happened to see

31:49.590 --> 31:51.320
Hesi, who always served Mr. He,

31:51.750 --> 31:53.410
secretly burning something.

31:54.070 --> 31:55.590
Before I could ask him anything,

31:55.590 --> 31:56.920
he became very nervous.

31:57.200 --> 31:58.600
He even gave me two taels,

31:58.620 --> 32:00.270
and asked me to keep quiet about it.

32:00.270 --> 32:02.160
I found it more and more suspicious,

32:02.160 --> 32:04.310
so I secretly went back to the courtyard.

32:04.310 --> 32:05.350
I saw with my own eyes

32:05.350 --> 32:06.750
that he hurriedly buried
the half-burned bloody clothes

32:06.750 --> 32:08.060
under a grape tree.

32:08.360 --> 32:09.470
Later I found out

32:10.440 --> 32:12.240
that Mr. Yang had been murdered.

32:13.310 --> 32:15.590
After that, Mr. He approached me,

32:16.070 --> 32:17.200
gave me fifty taels,

32:18.300 --> 32:20.100
and asked me to say
those things.

32:20.350 --> 32:21.880
I was just greedy for a moment.

32:21.880 --> 32:23.480
I didn't mean to harm anyone.

32:23.510 --> 32:25.110
Please be merciful, My Lord.

32:25.650 --> 32:26.350
Those fifty taels

32:26.350 --> 32:28.280
were the price of your conscience.

32:28.550 --> 32:30.750
The taels you received
was ill-gotten from the start.

32:30.750 --> 32:33.000
Your guilty conscience
made you desperate to get out of prison.

32:33.000 --> 32:34.750
Hesi, who was afraid
that you'd spill the truth,

32:34.750 --> 32:37.120
couldn't bear the risk
and decided to kill you.

32:37.120 --> 32:37.760
Hesi,

32:38.790 --> 32:40.110
if you don't
name the mastermind behind this,

32:40.110 --> 32:40.790
you'll be charged

32:40.790 --> 32:42.650
as the murderer of Yang Dingchen.

32:43.110 --> 32:45.270
Can you touch your neck and ask yourself

32:45.270 --> 32:48.440
if you can
bear the punishment of beheading?

32:51.310 --> 32:52.570
It was my Young Master.

32:56.960 --> 32:59.490
Miss,
Mr. He is outside requesting to see you.

33:01.810 --> 33:02.480
Let him in.

33:03.350 --> 33:03.880
Yes.

33:21.880 --> 33:22.670
Miss Rong,

33:23.350 --> 33:25.350
I have something urgent to tell you.

33:25.400 --> 33:27.460
It'd be better if we speak in private.

33:40.270 --> 33:41.550
My Young Master ordered me

33:41.550 --> 33:43.310
to burn the bloodstained clothes.

33:43.310 --> 33:44.680
I only burned half of them

33:44.680 --> 33:46.440
because I feared
he might kill me afterward.

33:46.440 --> 33:48.770
I wanted to keep some evidence for myself,

33:49.030 --> 33:50.830
so I buried the remaining pieces

33:51.840 --> 33:53.190
under a tree.

33:56.330 --> 33:57.120
I'll head back to Rong Mansion first.

33:57.120 --> 33:59.120
Gather your men and follow me later.

33:59.390 --> 34:00.320
What's the rush?

34:00.930 --> 34:02.110
Take him through the back door.

34:02.110 --> 34:02.960
Keep it discreet.

34:02.960 --> 34:04.120
Yes, My Lord. Don't worry.

34:04.120 --> 34:05.480
Gather my men immediately.

34:05.480 --> 34:07.510
I'm heading to the Rong Mansion
to seize the criminal!

34:07.510 --> 34:08.590
During the ceremony,

34:08.590 --> 34:10.510
the incident
with the genuine and counterfeit Tea Bone

34:10.510 --> 34:13.190
has stirred considerable talk
among the common folk.

34:13.190 --> 34:14.150
You should have kept

34:14.150 --> 34:15.610
a close eye on Rong Yunwan.

34:16.030 --> 34:17.400
How could you let her

34:17.400 --> 34:19.730
fall into the murderer's hands so easily?

34:21.960 --> 34:24.159
Unless you had already grown wary of her

34:24.590 --> 34:26.250
and secretly wished her dead.

34:27.230 --> 34:29.290
You deliberately turned a blind eye,

34:29.409 --> 34:30.590
and that was your calculated negligence.

34:30.590 --> 34:31.320
He Xingming!

34:34.920 --> 34:35.719
You're angry?

34:38.150 --> 34:39.550
That's understandable.

34:41.320 --> 34:43.719
Since ancient times, people die for wealth

34:43.730 --> 34:44.989
and birds die for food.

34:45.440 --> 34:46.790
My two half-brothers

34:46.810 --> 34:47.730
hate me too.

34:47.900 --> 34:49.100
They hate me to death.

34:51.360 --> 34:53.030
Moreover, she is the real one,

34:55.489 --> 34:56.880
and you are fake.

34:58.550 --> 35:01.080
How can one mountain
accommodate two tigers?

35:01.630 --> 35:05.170
If one doesn't look out for themselves,
heaven and earth'll destroy them.

35:05.170 --> 35:07.900
Our Rong family
is different from your He family.

35:08.280 --> 35:09.880
The bond between our sisters

35:10.550 --> 35:12.210
is not for you to judge rashly.

35:12.550 --> 35:13.550
Judge rashly?

35:15.510 --> 35:16.960
She was your own flesh-and-blood sister,

35:16.960 --> 35:18.620
born from the same womb as you.

35:19.190 --> 35:20.230
When she died,

35:20.710 --> 35:22.040
you hastily buried her,

35:22.280 --> 35:23.230
not even placing her

35:23.230 --> 35:24.670
in the Rong family cemetery.

35:24.670 --> 35:25.480
Doesn't this show

35:25.480 --> 35:26.610
how guilty you feel?

35:29.920 --> 35:31.280
As for that Yang,

35:31.920 --> 35:32.670
he must have

35:32.670 --> 35:34.110
something bad about you

35:34.510 --> 35:35.910
and forced you to give in,

35:36.070 --> 35:38.400
while trying to form a marriage alliance.

35:38.760 --> 35:39.550
This way,

35:39.550 --> 35:40.510
all the secrets

35:40.670 --> 35:42.760
can be covered up neatly.

35:43.800 --> 35:44.800
Isn't that right?

35:46.440 --> 35:47.280
Rong Shanbao.

35:48.850 --> 35:49.760
You're afraid!

35:50.110 --> 35:50.670
Shut up!

35:52.670 --> 35:53.550
Rong Shanbao.

36:05.550 --> 36:06.360
Rong Shanbao.

36:08.380 --> 36:10.840
If you're willing
to stoop to Yang Dingchen,

36:11.190 --> 36:12.110
why can't you

36:12.110 --> 36:13.880
humble yourself and beg me?

36:15.510 --> 36:16.800
As long as you beg me,

36:18.000 --> 36:19.400
all those rumors outside

36:20.360 --> 36:21.360
will be dealt with

36:21.510 --> 36:22.880
within three days.

36:23.400 --> 36:25.460
I won't let you worry about anything.

36:26.160 --> 36:28.330
Your Rong family and my He family

36:29.150 --> 36:30.750
would become one from now on.

36:31.110 --> 36:33.110
All the tea plantations in the south

36:33.360 --> 36:34.670
would be in our hands,

36:36.000 --> 36:37.260
and that sea route too.

36:37.330 --> 36:37.960
Get out!

36:42.960 --> 36:44.760
I've been calculating every move,

36:44.760 --> 36:46.280
and planning meticulously,

36:46.280 --> 36:47.670
but it's all for you!

36:49.000 --> 36:50.030
For me?

36:52.250 --> 36:53.780
You're doing it for profit.

37:00.240 --> 37:01.040
Rong Shanbao.

37:01.880 --> 37:03.230
You know the Rong and He families

37:03.230 --> 37:04.470
have been enemies for years.

37:04.470 --> 37:06.110
You hate me, despise me,

37:06.920 --> 37:07.780
and suspect me.

37:08.800 --> 37:09.400
I know full well

37:09.400 --> 37:11.330
that I shouldn't and can't do this,

37:11.840 --> 37:13.400
but I came anyway.

37:15.230 --> 37:15.840
The first year

37:15.840 --> 37:17.500
when I saw you on the tea route,

37:17.840 --> 37:20.040
I secretly followed you for a long time.

37:20.150 --> 37:21.610
I secretly swore to myself

37:22.590 --> 37:23.670
that I would make

37:23.670 --> 37:25.600
all the mortal enemies in your life

37:26.550 --> 37:27.960
rot in the desert.

37:29.180 --> 37:30.780
But when I saw with my own eyes

37:31.760 --> 37:34.320
you killing bandits and vipers,

37:36.070 --> 37:38.730
and your beautiful hands
were covered in blood,

37:39.710 --> 37:41.030
I was happier for you

37:41.030 --> 37:43.160
than I've ever been for my own success.

37:43.370 --> 37:44.480
All these years,

37:45.150 --> 37:46.920
you've saved countless tea plantations,

37:46.920 --> 37:49.280
and become a deity
in the hearts of tea farmers.

37:49.280 --> 37:50.360
Yet in this family,

37:51.670 --> 37:54.000
you're always misunderstood and framed.

37:54.760 --> 37:55.820
It breaks my heart.

37:57.090 --> 37:58.490
It truly breaks my heart.

38:11.230 --> 38:12.670
I can be your shield.

38:14.300 --> 38:14.960
I can be

38:14.960 --> 38:16.220
the blade in your hand.

38:17.150 --> 38:18.400
I'll shelter you from wind and rain.

38:18.400 --> 38:19.800
I'll charge into battle.

38:20.030 --> 38:21.880
Even if it means killing someone,

38:21.880 --> 38:22.960
I will do it for you.

38:23.670 --> 38:24.670
I can do anything.

38:27.010 --> 38:27.800
If Miss Rong

38:27.800 --> 38:29.330
truly believed your words,

38:31.440 --> 38:33.340
it'd be like keeping a venomous snake,

38:33.340 --> 38:34.600
and she'd have to constantly guard against

38:34.600 --> 38:35.660
you turning on her.

38:37.760 --> 38:39.800
Lu Fusheng, what are you saying?

38:40.280 --> 38:42.010
Miss Rong, Hesi has confessed.

38:42.280 --> 38:44.580
Mr. Yang was killed by Mr. He.

38:45.230 --> 38:48.560
He even revealed
where he buried the bloodstained clothes.

38:51.190 --> 38:52.650
You killed Yang Dingchen?

38:54.420 --> 38:54.970
Stop!

38:55.000 --> 38:56.260
Tell them all to leave.

38:57.150 --> 38:57.800
Leave.

38:58.320 --> 38:59.120
Everyone out.

39:04.110 --> 39:05.070
You go out too.

39:06.840 --> 39:07.590
Mr. He.

39:08.320 --> 39:10.670
You're the heir
to the Huqiu Tea of the He family.

39:10.670 --> 39:12.260
Why would you ruin your future

39:12.260 --> 39:14.190
by plotting to kill Yang Dingchen?

39:16.930 --> 39:18.930
Since I was little,
there's never been anything

39:18.930 --> 39:21.060
I wanted that I didn't eventually get.

39:21.320 --> 39:22.630
If you won't be with me,

39:23.320 --> 39:24.960
I'd rather see you shattered to pieces

39:24.960 --> 39:27.890
than give anyone else
the slightest chance with you.

39:33.480 --> 39:35.940
That night,
I snuck into the bridal chamber.

39:39.070 --> 39:41.000
He was already dying from illness.

39:41.270 --> 39:42.930
I merely hastened his journey

39:43.270 --> 39:46.290
by sending him to paradise sooner
to spare him suffering.

39:46.290 --> 39:47.820
He was supposed to thank me.

40:19.170 --> 40:21.030
Then why did you kill Rong Yunwan?

40:21.210 --> 40:23.360
Yang Dingchen
just wouldn't stop pestering me.

40:23.360 --> 40:24.560
So utterly annoying!

40:24.920 --> 40:25.960
He died. So what?

40:26.360 --> 40:28.890
It was supposed
to be completely undetectable,

40:28.890 --> 40:30.510
but who knew your foolish sister

40:30.510 --> 40:31.480
would burst in.

40:36.480 --> 40:37.630
Sister.

40:40.920 --> 40:42.070
Sister.

40:50.530 --> 40:51.490
Sister.

40:59.340 --> 41:00.010
Sister.

41:11.320 --> 41:13.400
Lady Yunwan? Lady Yunwan?

41:14.140 --> 41:14.710
Lady Yunwan?

41:14.710 --> 41:15.710
Someone's there!

41:17.280 --> 41:18.320
Sister!

41:18.840 --> 41:20.100
-Mummy!
-Lady Yunwan!

41:21.230 --> 41:22.760
Lady Yunwan, where are you?

41:24.400 --> 41:25.660
How did you end up here?

41:26.550 --> 41:28.400
Someone's here! There's blood!

41:28.400 --> 41:29.230
This is not a place

41:29.230 --> 41:30.000
for Lady Yunwan to wander.

41:30.000 --> 41:30.510
If we're discovered,

41:30.510 --> 41:31.550
I'll be scolded.

41:31.590 --> 41:32.030
Hurry!

41:33.110 --> 41:33.640
Let's go.

41:34.590 --> 41:35.150
I didn't know if she

41:35.150 --> 41:36.550
had seen my face clearly.

41:36.940 --> 41:38.800
To prevent her from ruining things later,

41:38.800 --> 41:41.130
I naturally had to eliminate this threat.

41:41.880 --> 41:42.550
Shanbo.

41:43.630 --> 41:44.630
These two people,

41:44.880 --> 41:46.370
one was a rogue who clung to you,

41:46.370 --> 41:48.340
the other was a hindrance in your way,

41:48.340 --> 41:49.870
and I eliminated them both.

41:51.230 --> 41:52.760
Haven't I treated you well?

41:52.880 --> 41:55.110
I'd rather sever ties
with marriage forever

41:55.110 --> 41:56.070
than bind myself to a man

41:56.070 --> 41:56.760
who schemes murder

41:56.760 --> 41:58.760
and harbors treachery in his heart.

41:58.840 --> 42:00.280
Then let's die together.

42:00.710 --> 42:01.280
Wait!

42:02.890 --> 42:03.710
Don't you want to know

42:03.710 --> 42:04.480
what Yang Dingchen has

42:04.480 --> 42:05.280
against me?

42:06.190 --> 42:07.720
The Rong family's treasure

42:07.880 --> 42:09.610
is hidden in this room, my room.

42:09.800 --> 42:10.230
Yang Dingchen

42:10.230 --> 42:11.690
somehow found out about it

42:11.880 --> 42:12.960
and used it to blackmail me,

42:12.960 --> 42:14.290
forcing me to marry him,

42:14.400 --> 42:15.860
or he'd tell Grandmother.

42:16.800 --> 42:18.600
There's a passage in that cellar

42:19.070 --> 42:21.130
that leads to the south pier of Linji.

42:21.840 --> 42:23.240
I can take you to the pier,

42:23.610 --> 42:24.970
if you spare my life.

42:25.680 --> 42:27.810
So Miss Rong is afraid of dying as well.

42:28.630 --> 42:30.750
How could there be any passage
in this room?

42:30.750 --> 42:32.460
Aren't you just stalling for time?

42:32.460 --> 42:34.480
Though Miss Rong is favored by Lady Rong,

42:34.480 --> 42:34.920
the Rong family

42:34.920 --> 42:36.370
has more than one daughter.

42:36.370 --> 42:37.800
To stop others from getting their hands
on the family fortune,

42:37.800 --> 42:38.230
Miss Rong

42:38.230 --> 42:39.670
naturally needs to plan ahead.

42:39.670 --> 42:40.920
She guards a mountain of gold,

42:40.920 --> 42:42.780
so what's hiding a few treasures?

42:43.010 --> 42:43.740
But Mr. He,

42:44.620 --> 42:46.020
you must decide quickly.

42:46.240 --> 42:46.950
If you delay any longer,

42:46.950 --> 42:48.510
once the government's officials arrive,

42:48.510 --> 42:50.370
even God won't be able to save you.

42:52.960 --> 42:54.640
I wouldn't risk my own life.

42:56.360 --> 42:59.160
Turn the base of that lamp
three times to the right,

42:59.250 --> 43:01.380
and you'll know I'm telling the truth.

43:11.040 --> 43:11.730
Mr. He,

43:13.230 --> 43:14.560
opening this mechanism

43:14.960 --> 43:16.760
is your only chance of survival.

43:18.520 --> 43:20.120
With Miss Rong as company,

43:20.280 --> 43:22.150
even if you lead me to death,

43:22.490 --> 43:25.700
I won't be lonely
on my way even to the underworld.

43:26.760 --> 43:27.890
Open the mechanism!

43:36.040 --> 43:37.970
Quick! Go in and arrest the killer.

43:38.670 --> 43:40.030
Open it! Hurry!

46:26.070 --> 46:28.430
[Purple Clay Teapot]

46:35.030 --> 46:36.840
Purple Clay Teapots are a unique form

46:35.550 --> 46:38.400
[This pot before us
also holds key insights.]

46:36.840 --> 46:38.760
of handcrafted ceramic tea ware
originating from China.

46:38.760 --> 46:39.590
They're made from the purple clay

46:39.590 --> 46:41.630
for which Yixing
in Jiangsu Province is famous.

46:41.630 --> 46:43.690
Originating in the Ming Dynasty
and flourishing in the Qing Dynasty,

46:43.690 --> 46:46.480
they are known for their subdued colors
and non-glossy texture.

46:46.480 --> 46:47.150
Purple Clay Teapots

46:47.150 --> 46:48.880
have a double-pore structure,

46:49.070 --> 46:50.870
with excellent breathability.

46:52.190 --> 46:54.700
They preserve the aroma of tea
to the fullest extent.

46:54.700 --> 46:56.480
They're renowned
for retaining the tea flavor

46:56.480 --> 46:59.110
and preventing discoloration
when storing tea.

46:59.110 --> 47:01.280
Their bodies also incorporate calligraphy

47:01.280 --> 47:03.770
and seal carving,
reflecting scholarly elegance.

47:03.770 --> 47:04.760
The teapot crafting techniques
pioneered by Ming Dynasty masters,

47:04.760 --> 47:06.370
including Gong Chun and Shi Dabin,

47:06.370 --> 47:07.750
have been

47:07.770 --> 47:09.100
passed down to this day.

47:10.790 --> 47:13.320
Purple Clay Teapots
are not just practical tea vessels,

47:13.320 --> 47:14.360
but also treasured works of art

47:14.360 --> 47:15.840
among scholars and refined individuals.

47:15.840 --> 47:18.030
They're honored
as the finest teaware in the world.
